<title>NORWAY: Norske Skog in merger talks on two units.</title>
<headline>Norske Skog in merger talks on two units.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian forestry group Norske Skog ASA and Moelven Industrier ASA may merge their units for saw mills and board production, the Oslo Bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>A brief statement said the companies had started a discussion on the subject because they agreed on the need for a restructuring of this sector in Norway.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
